From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:35:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] A-Z strip on a playlist sorted by artist or album

Sorted by artist, a jump to K now means artists starting with K, and sorted by album,
albums starting with K. The playlist opts the artist and album orders into the strip
(PLAYLIST_LETTER_SORT_KEYS); the library listings keep to the name orders, since they filter
by the track's own name column. Each row is filed by its first artist or its album so the
strip highlights the letter being scrolled through. Tests first.
---
